1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:03,968
Walking into a health centre? Skip the front desk.

2
00:00:03,988 --> 00:00:07,168
Meet Dawri, the AI front desk for walk-ins.

3
00:00:08,568 --> 00:00:13,536
Step one: tell it what's wrong, in Arabic or English, by text or voice.

4
00:00:13,556 --> 00:00:16,818
It asks a few short questions, one at a time.

5
00:00:16,838 --> 00:00:20,444
Step two: pick a health centre, with estimated waits.

6
00:00:20,464 --> 00:00:25,800
Step three: when you arrive, tap “I'm here”, and your ticket gets its number.

7
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:29,909
Then follow your turn. The nurse already has your answers, and your allergies.

8
00:00:29,929 --> 00:00:32,194
Doctor. Pharmacy. Done.

9
00:00:33,344 --> 00:00:38,088
And if it sounds like an emergency, Dawri tells you to call 999. No queue.

10
00:00:39,138 --> 00:00:39,948
Dawri.

11
00:00:39,948 --> 00:00:42,023
Arrive, don't register.

12
00:00:42,043 --> 00:00:43,643
Try the demo today.
